    "result_text": "The build passes. The change is complete.\n\nI added a disposable-domain blocklist check to owner creation in `OwnerRestControllerV1`:\n\n1. Added a `DISPOSABLE_EMAIL_DOMAINS` set (`mailinator.com`, `tempmail.com`, `guerrillamail.com`).\n2. Extended `normalizeEmail` to extract the email's domain and reject it with `InvalidOwnerFieldsException` (which maps to a **400 Bad Request**) when the domain is on the blocklist. The check runs after the existing syntactic validation and uses the lower-cased form, so the match is case-insensitive.\n\nThe test suite is green (`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`, BUILD SUCCESS), including the new `errorRejectsDisposableDomain` acceptance test.",
